{"leftColumnItems":[{"text":"新领袖适配","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_JULIUS_CAESAR.html\">尤里乌斯·凯撒</a>LA：建立或征服城市时+200<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。清除蛮族哨站+200<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。征服一个城市后，3个单元格内的单位永久+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_STRENGTH.png\" alt=\"ICON_STRENGTH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>战斗力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_ABRAHAM_LINCOLN.html\">亚伯拉罕·林肯</a>LA：工业区+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_AMENITIES.png\" alt=\"ICON_AMENITIES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>宜居度。建造工业区后获得一个免费的建造者。允许在工业区解放建造者，为该工业区提供+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力相邻加成，如果在本城第一次进行解放，额外+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CITIZEN.png\" alt=\"ICON_CITIZEN\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>人口。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_SALADIN_ALT.html\">萨拉丁（苏丹）</a>LA：为所有战斗和宗教单位+100%夹击和支援加成。所有单位在与你的创建的宗教相同宗教的城市开始一个回合，会获得1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>移动力加成。宗教单位无视区域控制效果。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_ARABIA.html\">阿拉伯</a>：原<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_SALADIN.html\">萨拉丁（维齐尔）</a>领袖单位<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/HEAVY_CAVALRY/UNIT_ARABIAN_MAMLUK.html\">奴隶兵</a>变为阿拉伯特色单位。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_KONGO.html\">刚果</a>UA：所有陆地单位无视森林和雨林对移动力的减益。每个<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GREATWORK_RELIC.png\" alt=\"ICON_GREATWORK_RELIC\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>遗物、<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GREATWORK_ARTIFACT.png\" alt=\"ICON_GREATWORK_ARTIFACT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文物、<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GREATWORK_PORTRAIT.png\" alt=\"ICON_GREATWORK_PORTRAIT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>肖像、风景、宗教、雕塑艺术和<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GREATWORK_MUSIC.png\" alt=\"ICON_GREATWORK_MUSIC\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>音乐巨作中获得+4<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物、+4<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力；每个巨著提供+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物、+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。宫殿有5个巨作槽位。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/leaders/LEADER_MVEMBA.html\">姆本巴·恩津加</a>LA改为：无法获得大预言家和创建宗教（可以建造圣地）。首次建成姆班赞后，激活“神学”、“王权神授”和“归正会”市政鼓舞。获得额外50%<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_WRITER.html\">大作家</a>、<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_ARTIST.html\">大艺术家</a>、<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_MUSICIAN.html\">大音乐家</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_MERCHANT.html\">大商人</a>点数。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"城邦改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/citystates/industrial/CIVILIZATION_CSD_PRAGUE.html\">布拉格</a>：移除解锁“学徒”科技后额外+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/citystates/cse_agricultural/CIVILIZATION_CSE_MOMBASA.html\">蒙巴萨</a>：有资伐木种植园+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币，探索后+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/citystates/scientific/CIVILIZATION_PALENQUE.html\">米特拉</a>：余粮从20%改为10%，新增学院和学院建筑+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物。</li><li>商业城邦和航海城邦的基础<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币加成由+2/+4/+6/+8改为+3/+6/+9/+12。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"区域&建筑改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_PRESERVE.html\">保护区</a>：造价从75<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力改为60<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。移除给相邻单元格+<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物的效果，改为本体+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_PRESERVE/BUILDING_GROVE.html\">古树林</a>：造价从120<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力改为75<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。本体+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值，相邻的森林、雨林、沼泽、绿洲单元格+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li>圣水域：重命名为<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_PRESERVE/BUILDING_HD_HOLYWATERS.html\">观海石</a>。造价从120<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力改为75<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。本体+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值，相邻的水域单元格+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li>隐修地：重命名为<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_PRESERVE/BUILDING_HD_MONASTERY.html\">神谕碑</a>。造价从120<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力改为75<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。本体+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰，相邻的迷人单元格+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值，惊艳单元格额外+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_AQUEDUCT/BUILDING_JNR_BATHHOUSE.html\">浴场</a>：移除本城的余粮+5%。特效重做为本城营地和牧场+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_AQUEDUCT/BUILDING_JNR_HAMMER_WORKS.html\">水力锻锤</a>：移除本城的余粮+5%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_AQUEDUCT/BUILDING_JNR_ORCHARD.html\">果园</a>：移除本城的余粮+5%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_JNR_GUILDHALL.html\">工商会馆</a>：从<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civics/ERA_RENAISSANCE/CIVIC_MERCANTILISM.html\">重商主义</a>移动到<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_MEDIEVAL/TECH_METAL_CASTING.html\">金属铸造</a>，造价从275<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力改为160<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。基础产出12金，效果改为此城出发的国内<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物和+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力，解锁“工业化”科技后给以本城为终点的国内<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线提供相同加成。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_JNR_MERCHANT_QUARTER.html\">商人中心</a>：从<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_RENAISSANCE/TECH_BANKING.html\">银行业</a>移动到<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civics/ERA_MEDIEVAL/CIVIC_MEDIEVAL_FAIRES.html\">中世纪集市</a>，造价从275<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力改为160<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。基础产出12金，效果改为此城出发的国际<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线+5<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币，解锁“重商主义”市政后翻倍。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_BANK.html\">银行</a>：从<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_RENAISSANCE/TECH_BANKING.html\">银行业</a>移动到<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civics/ERA_MEDIEVAL/CIVIC_GUILDS.html\">公会</a>，造价从275<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力改为160<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。基础产出10金6环辐射，效果改为解锁“银行业”科技后在此城购买费用减少15%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CAMPUS/BUILDING_LIBRARY.html\">图书馆</a>：造价从100<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力降低为90<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力，基础产出从2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值提升为3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_THEATER/BUILDING_AMPHITHEATER.html\">古罗马剧场</a>：<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_WRITER.html\">大作家</a>点数从4降低为2。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER/BUILDING_TOTEMS.html\">图腾柱</a>：从<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civics/ERA_ANCIENT/CIVIC_CODE_OF_LAWS.html\">法典</a>移动到<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_ANCIENT/TECH_ASTROLOGY.html\">占星术</a>。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_JNR_WAYSTATION.html\">货栈</a>：特效改为消耗2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>马产生2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_INDUSTRIAL_ZONE/BUILDING_JNR_TOOLING_SHOP.html\">工具铺</a>：特效改为消耗2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>铁产生3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"奇观改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_HUEY_TEOCALLI.html\">休伊神庙</a>：对地块的加成改为您帝国内的每个湖泊单元格和相邻湖泊的单元格+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物、+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_ST_BASILS_CATHEDRAL.html\">圣瓦西里主教座堂</a>：对地块的加成改为6个单元格内的所有冻土单元格+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物、+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力、+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/WON_CL_KINKAKU.html\">金阁寺</a>：条件6个单元格内改为拥有圣地2级建筑的城市。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_EIFFEL_TOWER.html\">埃菲尔铁塔</a>：新增全境内+25%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TOURISM.png\" alt=\"ICON_TOURISM\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>旅游业绩。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_TEMPLE_ARTEMIS.html\">阿耳忒弥斯神庙</a>：+6<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_HOUSING.png\" alt=\"ICON_HOUSING\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>住房，4个单元格内的每个牧场、种植园和改良资源的营地+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_AMENITIES.png\" alt=\"ICON_AMENITIES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>宜居度。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/P0K_BUILDING_TEMPLE_POSEIDON.html\">波塞冬神庙</a>：+6<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_HOUSING.png\" alt=\"ICON_HOUSING\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>住房，4个单元格内的每个渔船+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_AMENITIES.png\" alt=\"ICON_AMENITIES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>宜居度，本城浅海和湖泊单元格+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_HANGING_GARDENS.html\">空中花园</a>：+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物改为+4。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_ABU_SIMBEL.html\">阿布辛贝神庙</a>：所有城市赠送<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER/BUILDING_GRANARY.html\">粮仓</a>，<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER/BUILDING_GRANARY.html\">粮仓</a>+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_GREAT_BATH.html\">大浴场</a>：移除所有地块沿河。新增沿河的城市+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_AMENITIES.png\" alt=\"ICON_AMENITIES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>宜居度。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_SUK_WAT_ARUN.html\">郑王庙</a>：每个伟人1点影响力改为2点，移除招募伟人返还<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_OXFORD_UNIVERSITY.html\">牛津大学</a>、<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_BOLSHOI_THEATRE.html\">莫斯科大剧院</a>、<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/WON_CL_BUILDING_ARECIBO.html\">阿雷西博天文台</a>：现在可以手选赠送的科技/市政。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"单位改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/SIEGE/UNIT_ANCIENT_SIEGE.html\">投石机</a>改名为<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/SIEGE/UNIT_TREBUCHET.html\">配重投石机</a>。</li><li>新增远古攻城单位<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/SIEGE/UNIT_ANCIENT_SIEGE.html\">投石机</a>，砌砖解锁，55<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>移动力近战15<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_STRENGTH.png\" alt=\"ICON_STRENGTH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>战斗力远程25攻城<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_STRENGTH.png\" alt=\"ICON_STRENGTH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>战斗力2射程。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"伟人改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_COLAEUS.html\">柯莱欧司</a>：效果改为激活城市生产开拓者时+25%建造速度。开拓者+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>移动力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_MARCUS_LICINIUS_CRASSUS.html\">马库斯·李锡尼·克拉苏</a>：激活次数改为2，效果改为获得100<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币，获得一个<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/MELEE/UNIT_SWORDSMAN.html\">剑士</a>，每回合提供1点<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>铁。</li><li>新增大商人<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_HD_CROESUS.html\">克罗索斯</a>：立即在该区域建造1座市场，所有商业1级建筑+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li>新增大商人<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_HD_SANG_HONGYANG.html\">桑弘羊</a>：立即在该区域建造1座铸币厂，铸币厂额外辐射1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_ZHANG_QIAN.html\">张骞</a>：效果改为+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线容量，赠送一个<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_TRADER.html\">商人</a>。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_MARCO_POLO.html\">马可波罗</a>：效果改为+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线容量，赠送一个<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_TRADER.html\">商人</a>，赠送送<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civics/ERA_RENAISSANCE/CIVIC_EXPLORATION.html\">探索</a>市政鼓舞。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_PIERO_DE_BARDI.html\">皮耶罗·迪·巴尔迪</a>：效果改为此后每建成一个<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB.html\">商业中心</a>送一个<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_ENVOY.png\" alt=\"ICON_ENVOY\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>使者。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_IBN_FADLAN.html\">伊本·法德兰</a>：效果改为+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线容量，赠送2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_ENVOY.png\" alt=\"ICON_ENVOY\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>使者。</li><li>新增<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_HD_ALI_MUGHAYAT_SYAH.html\">阿里·穆哈亚·斯亚</a>：效果改为赠送1个<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_SETTLER.html\">开拓者</a>和1个<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_BUILDER.html\">建造者</a>。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_GIOVANNI_DE_MEDICI.html\">乔凡尼·德·美第奇</a>：效果改为送<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_BANK.html\">银行</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_MARKET.html\">市场</a>。<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_BANK.html\">银行</a>获得两个可以存放产品的巨作槽位。购买<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_THEATER.html\">剧院广场</a>建筑打折25%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_JAKOB_FUGGER.html\">雅各布·富格尔</a>：效果改为赠送2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_ENVOY.png\" alt=\"ICON_ENVOY\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>使者和400<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。商业中心和工业区从相邻区域获得额外标准相邻加成。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_RAJA_TODAR_MAL.html\">拉贾·托达·马尔</a>：效果改为赠送2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_ENVOY.png\" alt=\"ICON_ENVOY\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>使者。国内<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线从目的地每个专业化区域获得2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_ZHOU_DAGUAN.html\">周达观</a>：效果改为赠送5<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_ENVOY.png\" alt=\"ICON_ENVOY\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>使者。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"政体&政策改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/commemorations/COMMEMORATION_SCIENTIFIC.html\">自由探索</a>：改为为文明提供科技值而非首都。</li><li>新增红卡<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/military/POLICY_BREEDING.html\">育种</a>：军营每回合产出1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>马，每个军营建筑每回合产出2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>马。</li><li>新增红卡<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/military/POLICY_FORGING.html\">锻造</a>：军营区域每回合产出1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>铁，每个军营建筑每回合产出2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>铁。</li><li>骑士阶级：更名为<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/military/POLICY_EQUESTRIAN_ORDERS.html\">战略储备</a>，效果改为军营区域每回合产出1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>马和1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>铁，每个军营建筑每回合产出2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>马和2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>铁。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/commemorations/COMMEMORATION_EXPLORATION.html\">此处有龙</a>：重做为新建立的城市+3人口，移民、海军、海运单位+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>移动力，没有专业化区域的城市建造区域时+100%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li>移除了遏制政策卡，其效果直接由<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civics/ERA_ATOMIC/CIVIC_COLD_WAR.html\">冷战</a>市政解锁。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/diplomatic/POLICY_TRIBUTE_TRADE.html\">朝贡贸易</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/diplomatic/POLICY_SELF_DETERMINATION.html\">民族自决</a>新增港口区域+1/+2影响力点数。</li><li>移除了工商食官和城市公社。</li><li>移除了除了徭役以外的所有城市政策。相应地移除了建筑边关和祭坛，等待后续重做。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"信条改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOLLOWER/BELIEF_MESSIAH.html\">弥赛亚</a>：重做。所有圣地建筑提供+4<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。购买市中心内建筑的费用降低20%且可以用<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰购买。圣地区域内建筑可以用<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰购买。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_HD_UTAKI.html\">御岳</a>：重做。海岸和湖泊单元格可为港口提供标准相邻加成。相邻港口的近海和湖泊单元格+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物，+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_GODDESS_OF_FESTIVALS.html\">节庆女神</a>：种植园+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物改为+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰，移除圣地给本城种植园+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_RELIGIOUS_IDOLS.html\">宗教偶像</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_TALE_OF_DWALVES.html\">黄金国传说</a>：改良战略资源的矿山也可以获得加成。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_GOD_OF_CRAFTSMEN.html\">工匠之神</a>：新增忽略科技要求显示<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/strategic/RESOURCE_HORSES.html\">马</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/strategic/RESOURCE_IRON.html\">铁</a>。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_MEGALITHIC_WORSHIP.html\">梦创时代</a>：采石场+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币改为+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_STONE_CIRCLES.html\">石圈</a>：采石场+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰改为+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_GOD_OF_THE_FORGE.html\">锻造之神</a>：回调。远古、古典和中世纪军事单位+50%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。生产单位所需战略资源花费减少40%。</li><li>移除万神殿太阳神、尚武精神和星光引导者。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_RELIGIOUS_SETTLEMENTS.html\">宗教移民</a>：重做。<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_SETTLER.html\">开拓者</a>+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>移动力，创建新城市时获得额外4个单元格和30<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_PROPHET.html\">大预言家</a>点数。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_DIVINE_SPARK.html\">神圣之光</a>：效果扩展到所有区域（剧院广场同时提供<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_WRITER.html\">大作家</a>、<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_ARTIST.html\">大艺术家</a>、<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_MUSICIAN.html\">大音乐家</a>点数）。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_FERTILITY_RITES.html\">丰产仪式</a>：新增所有<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER/BUILDING_GRANARY.html\">粮仓</a>+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_MONUMENT_TO_THE_GODS.html\">主神纪念碑</a>：新增所有<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER/BUILDING_MONUMENT.html\">纪念碑</a>+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。移除建造奇观加速。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"改良改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/unique/IMPROVEMENT_HACIENDA.html\">大庄园</a>：移除可以获得种植园额外产出的特效（该特效导致AI对万神殿口述传统的倾向过高）。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/unique/IMPROVEMENT_OUTBACK_STATION.html\">内陆牧场</a>：移除可以获得牧场额外产出的特效（该特效导致AI对万神殿天空之神的倾向过高）。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"总督改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_MERCHANT.html\">瑞娜</a>基础升级地产商人：改为此城每<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CITIZEN.png\" alt=\"ICON_CITIZEN\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>人口产出3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_MERCHANT.html\">瑞娜</a>左2港务局长：改为此城商业中心、港口+100%相邻加成。如果此城有商业中心和港口则+1区域位。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_MERCHANT.html\">瑞娜</a>右2林业管理：改为在此城中购买单位时-20%花费，购买商人时额外-20%花费。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_MERCHANT.html\">瑞娜</a>中3市舶榷务：改为+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线容量。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_MERCHANT.html\">瑞娜</a>左4金融中心：未改动（城市中每有一座商业中心建筑和港口建筑，<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币产出便+8%）。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_MERCHANT.html\">瑞娜</a>右4跨国公司：改为城市中每有一座商业中心建筑和港口建筑，从此城开始的国际<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线+6<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。研究资本主义市政后此城的产品提供的<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TOURISM.png\" alt=\"ICON_TOURISM\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>旅游业绩+100%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_RESOURCE_MANAGER.html\">马格努斯</a>左4总务厅：改为市政广场/外交区地基分别给8个单元格内城市+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力/+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值，其中每有一级建筑便翻一次倍。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"行业与公司模式改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/ResourceCategory/GROWTH.html\">食品生产类</a>行业：移除城市中每位公民+0.5<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物产出。商路产出增加由+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物改为+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/ResourceCategory/GPP.html\">饮品类</a>行业：有社区的城市额外提供的每位公民<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值和<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值产出从0.6降低为0.3。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/ResourceCategory/WONDER.html\">建筑材料类</a>行业：奇观提供的<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值从3降低为2。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/ResourceCategory/TOURISM.html\">首饰类</a>行业：移除商业中心区域为奇观和区域额外提供的+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值和+4<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/ResourceCategory/MEDICINE.html\">药材类</a>行业：移除学院区域为奇观和区域额外提供的+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值和+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/ResourceCategory/GROWTH.html\">食品生产类</a>公司：全国+10%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物改为+10%城市人口增长速度。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/ResourceCategory/AMENITY.html\">日常用品类</a>公司：移除全国+10%城市人口增长速率，<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_AMENITIES.png\" alt=\"ICON_AMENITIES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>宜居度从1提升为3。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/resources/ResourceCategory/MEDICINE.html\">药材类</a>公司：<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TECHBOOSTED.png\" alt=\"ICON_TECHBOOSTED\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>尤里卡提供的科技值从+3%降低为+2%。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"AI改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>降低AI赠送战略的数量。</li><li>神难度AI的生产力加成从85+15n调整为60+15n。</li><li>王子以上难度AI新增加成：除了<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_PROPHET.html\">大预言家</a>以外，所有区域和建筑+1对应伟人点。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"科技&市政改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>古典前排由180<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值调整为160<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li>文艺复兴后排由1500<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值调整为1400<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li>工业前排由1800<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值调整为2000<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li>工业后排由2100<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值调整为2400<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li>现代前排由2700<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值调整为3000<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li>现代后排由3300<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值调整为3500<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"项目改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>移除除了<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/historic_moments/other/PROJECT_CARNIVAL.html\">狂欢节</a>以外的区域项目伟人点，区域项目产出转换翻倍。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"地图改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>优化了奢侈生成代码，现在奢侈分布更均匀（一定不会相邻）。</li><li>新增设定，在建立首都后，如果一定范围内没有某种战略资源，会在该范围最远的合法单元格生成一个该资源。对于<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_HORSES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>马<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_IRON.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_IRON\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>铁是6个单元格，<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_RESOURCE_NITER.png\" alt=\"ICON_RESOURCE_NITER\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>硝石是9个单元格，其它战略是12个单元格。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"bug修复","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>原康提宗主国丢失后加成会永久丢失，因此将效果改为遗物提供+4<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。</li><li>修复了原版祭祀建筑的<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰产出与信条文本不符的bug（已统一对齐为+8<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰）。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_AZTEC.html\">阿兹特克</a>UA荣冠战争改名为鲜花战争。</li><li>补充了<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civilizations/civilizations/CIVILIZATION_BOOM_ASSYRIA_HD.html\">亚述</a>特色单位<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/SUPPORT/UNIT_BOOM_SIEGE_ENGINE.html\">攻城车</a>的攻城效果文本。</li><li>修复了<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_DIPLOMATIC_QUARTER/BUILDING_CHANCERY.html\">外交办</a>提供的外交能见度失效的bug。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""}],"language":"zh_Hans","title":"v1.3.3更新日志"}